{"id":"906680bfce5f44c0","group":"92","path":"92/92-ax-generalization.md","title":"Generalization Rule","display":"ax-generalization — Generalization Rule","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ax-generalization","aliases":["92-ax-generalization"],"display":"ax-generalization — Generalization Rule","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-inference-rule]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ax-generalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ax-generalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-generalization — Generalization Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable symbol, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\)</span> (space of rule instances, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> (definition-target rule set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}generalization} \\vdash \\mathrm{Gen}\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle,\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}generalization} \\vdash \\mathrm{Gen}\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle,\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> : Generalization推理规则</li>\n<li>从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\;\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是谓词逻辑的推理规则</li>\n<li>系统G的基本推理规则之一</li>\n<li>作为无假设的定理级规则，Generalization 本身不需要额外侧条件；若在带开放假设的派生中使用，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不能在任何未解除假设中自由出现</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":